sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as CLI
    participant A as API
    participant W as Worker
    U->>C: run job
    C->>A: POST /jobs
    A->>W: enqueue
    A-->>C: 202, id
    C-->>U: id
    loop every 5 s
        C->>A: GET /jobs/id
    end
    alt job done
        A-->>C: result
    else job failed
        W-xA: report failure
        A-->>C: error
    end
    Note over A,W: the worker retries up to 3 times
